OL,3,GNEWSA'Foreign imports are hurting our
OL,4,Astrawberries'
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe owner of a strawberry farm in
OL,7,FWorcestershire says the changing
OL,8,Fclimate is extending their growing
OL,9,Fseason, leaving many strawberries
OL,10,Funpicked and unsold.
OL,12,FBal Padda runs the 150-acre Vicarage
OL,13,FNurseries, in Bretforton, and says his
OL,14,Fbusiness is slowing their operation
OL,15,Fdown due to a drop in demand.
OL,17,F"We're putting it on hold today. We
OL,18,Fpicked yesterday but have no order
OL,19,Ftoday. The demand drops down", he said.
OL,23,APub: 08-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
